        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Mound%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sits on FM 156, roughly eight miles north of Fort Worth in north‑central Tarrant County.",
