    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During the 1950s Bell Helicopter used Kennedy’s plant to develop new helicopters before leaving in 1960.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Mound%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Kennedy’s original land purchase covered 400 acres bordered by East McLeroy Boulevard and FM 156, laying the groundwork for the town’s layout.",
